==Trivia==
*Sweet Bro Cats is based off of a [[wikipedia:Dango|hanami dango]].
*Sweet Bro Cats' Japanese name, Dango Nyan Kyōdai, is a reference to the children's song "Dango 3 Kyōdai" or "Dango San Kyōdai". Their Japanese description says, "It seems that the one on top is not the eldest son," while the song's lyrics state otherwise.
*Sweet Bro Cats closely resemble a finalist in the Battle Cats Design Contest.
*They are the only seasonal gacha cat that isn't a variant of another unit.

